OL,3,AWhy the US midterms sparked an AI stock
OL,4,Aselloff
OL,5,
OL,6,FIs the artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,7,Fgold rush coming to an end, or is this
OL,8,Fsimply a reality check?
OL,10,FThat's the question which is hanging
OL,11,Fover investors, and which has prompted
OL,12,Fsteep falls on the world's stock
OL,13,Fmarkets.
OL,15,FThe sell-off in the US on Thursday was
OL,16,Fmost dramatic on the Nasdaq, home to
OL,17,Ftech industry titans such as Alphabet,
OL,18,FNvidia, Meta and Apple.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
